# Sample dataset: keep the prediction JSONs (small, reproducible sample runs)
# but not the raw third-party video clips (large + copyright). The empty dir
# is preserved via .gitkeep so the batch script's default path exists.
# See dataset/README.md.
dataset/sample_raw_videos/*
!dataset/sample_raw_videos/.gitkeep
